{"ID":"20240522082306-bddwcdn","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082306-bddwcdn","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082306-bddwcdn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522084528-0oj9a21\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522084718-guedzvc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:453,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522084718-guedzvc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"腦意外撞傷昏迷的急救","type":"doc","updated":"20240522084718"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522084528-0oj9a21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-0oj9a21","updated":"20240522084528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"人紀外科事件簿 : 意外昏迷"}]},{"ID":"20240522084528-t39ctkx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-t39ctkx","updated":"20240522084528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"發生日期 : 2008.05.07 早上"}]},{"ID":"20240522084528-rclhs6g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-rclhs6g","updated":"20240522084528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"發生地點 : 病患住家附近"}]},{"ID":"20240522084528-n2z4orj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-n2z4orj","updated":"20240522084528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"受害人 : 中年婦人"}]},{"ID":"20240522084528-5nhj8g5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-5nhj8g5","updated":"20240522084528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"事由 :     婦人外出溜狗, 突然狗向前衝, 導致人被絆倒, 不慎跌落山溝,"}]},{"ID":"20240522084528-kg2bk74","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-kg2bk74","updated":"20240522084528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"頭部右側撞傷, 右眼處腫脹, 昏迷不醒. 當被人發現時, 已隔半小時, 送到當地醫院的急診室時., 醫生要求開刀降腦壓."}]},{"ID":"20240522084528-egr51kl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-egr51kl","updated":"20240522084528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"處理流程 :"}]},{"ID":"20240522084528-bsyurb8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-bsyurb8","updated":"20240522084528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          2008.05.07"}]},{"ID":"20240522084528-5gpa7ak","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-5gpa7ak","updated":"20240522084616"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522084528-7nu0qxx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-7nu0qxx","updated":"20240522084616"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522084528-zc16plq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-zc16plq","updated":"20240522084616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"急診室醫師要求連絡家屬, 因腦壓很重, 需立即開刀, 我臨時央請有執照的中西醫師(人紀班同學)至急診室對病患做"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"十宣放血和百會放血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":". 做完之後, 病患的臉色, 由一片紫黑開始變成較有血色, 叫她已有反應, 可坐起一會, 喊著想吐, 又昏迷過去, 然醫生說腦壓已降, 不用開刀, 繼續觀察."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240522084528-o4b915c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-o4b915c","updated":"20240522084543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(心裡暗想, , 簡單的十宣放血和百會放血, 居然可以把人從中度昏迷拉回, 少挨一刀, 可能還有風險及後遺症, 真是讚嘆及感恩古人之智慧及老師之教導, 也在此特別感謝人紀班學長, 義不容辭, 挺身相助)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084528-ka8q0ho","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-ka8q0ho","updated":"20240522084622"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522084528-xudmb06","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-xudmb06","updated":"20240522084622"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522084528-5h3j2b2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-5h3j2b2","updated":"20240522084622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病患因該院加護病房沒有空位, 因而轉往另一家公立醫院加護病房, 學生開始做第二階段的救治. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"利用人紀金匱所教, 剪下病人左邊頭角上的頭髮, 燒成了灰, 將髮灰從耳朵吹進頭腦裏去."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240522084528-93mlyw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-93mlyw9","updated":"20240522084545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(做這些動作可以跟護士小姐說, 是要幫病人收驚, 否則可能會被制止, 燒髮灰不要在醫院做, 味道很濃, 大家會注意,),"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084528-1u1uf3y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-1u1uf3y","updated":"20240522084657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"學生在當天晚上看診時間, 帶著我朋友的髮灰, 用吸管吹進她的右耳, 神奇的現象出現了, 病人馬上眼睛就張開且坐了起來, 把我也嚇了一跳, 她嘴裡還碎碎念, “今天運氣真的很不好…”, 還嚷著要小便, 護士走過來很疑惑的說, 她昏迷了一下午, 怎麼醒了, 我心理想, 要不是你們看病時間限制, 耽誤我救人, 我朋友下午就可以醒了, 只可惜看診時間很短, 每次吹的髮灰不多, 只好再跟護士講, 收驚一次不夠, 還要再剪第二次頭髮, 只有明天早上再來吹髮灰, 就這樣連續三次, 病人已開始清醒, 學生就請她開始服用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"補陽還五湯和血府逐瘀湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":", 一直到現在, 病人復原的狀況都很好. 幾乎沒有後遺症, 只有發生意外的那段記憶. 記不太起來."}]},{"ID":"20240522084528-cwlqi4o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-cwlqi4o","updated":"20240522084548"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(也好, 不好的回憶, 就讓它隨風飄, 老師說人要活的開心嘛!)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084528-43s69ow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-43s69ow","updated":"20240522084528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"結論 :"}]},{"ID":"20240522084528-ms3l8u1","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-ms3l8u1","updated":"20240522084528"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522084528-o4gzh3f","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-o4gzh3f","updated":"20240522084528"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522084528-zfahavc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-zfahavc","updated":"20240522084528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"若是學生沒學人紀, 此種意外, 也許我這位朋友就如不久後, 同樣發生昏迷而往生的廖風德前部長一樣. 也許就往生了, 或者就算痊癒, 也有可能有很多後遺症, 乃至變成植物人而遺憾終生. 人紀真是一門可以把人從鬼門關前拉回的寶貴學問, 真是感恩老師願意深入淺出的把我們這些毫無中醫基礎的學生, 提拔到可以隨緣救人, 日後定當努力弘揚經方大法, 幫助世人."}]}]},{"ID":"20240522084528-565azrm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-565azrm","updated":"20240522084528"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522084528-s0iyv15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-s0iyv15","updated":"20240522084528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之後學生就此案例與楊師姐請教治療的原理, 她解釋是因為同氣相求, 髮為血之餘, 所以髮灰破血能力很強., 人的左邊主血, 右邊主氣, 而意外昏迷不醒通常是因為腦部有瘀血塊造成. 所以取左邊頭角之髮, 而取頭角之髮, 是採取近取法的意思. 所以取左邊頭角的髮, 燒成髮灰, 從耳朵吹進腦袋, 即可破腦中瘀血, 所以病患可以馬上清醒."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240522084528-sbq3v49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-sbq3v49","updated":"20240522084528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522084528-bb0x1oh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-bb0x1oh","updated":"20240522084528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"學生 十方 敬書"}]},{"ID":"20240522084528-51pndbi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-51pndbi","updated":"20240522084528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522084528-ui2nc6u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-ui2nc6u","updated":"20240522084708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語 : "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這位人紀DVD學員，沒有忘記黃帝內經中提到的急救法，使用病人的頭髮燒灰來噴入耳中，可以叫醒昏迷中的病人，由於他的善用此法，讓病人迅速的獲救，免除腦部缺氧造成的傷害，也由於正確的施治，病人終於平安出院，而且沒有一點後遺症留下，真是功德無量的行為，希望同學們都能記取分享這個案例的急救過程，務必讓你們周圍的親朋好友都能受惠於此案例，西醫的急救絕對有其功效所在，但是如果能將中醫的急救法與西醫混合在一起，這就是病人的福氣了，希望西醫師都能虛心的接受這種既無副作用又不需要花錢，又簡單到人人都會使用的方法，大家就都有無量的功德了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084528-ju5gftp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084528-ju5gftp","updated":"20240522084528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫  倪海廈謹記於台北07/21/2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522084712-9w7nj58","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522084712-9w7nj58"}},{"ID":"20240522084718-guedzvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084718-guedzvc"}}]}